# Katalon
# website: https://katalon.com
# docs: https://docs.katalon.com/katalon-studio/
# description: Katalon Studio test automation suite ignoring compiled test artifacts, execution reports, runtime caches, and generated workspace metadata.

# Compiled Groovy and Java test classes
*.class
bin/
bin/lib/
bin/lib/TempTestCase*
Libs/
Libs/TempTestCase*
Libs/TempTestSuite*

# Build and output directories
build/
output/*
!output/.gitkeep

# Test execution reports and logs
Reports/
*.log
hs_err_pid*

# Katalon Studio workspace and Gradle cache
.cache/
.gradle/
.classpath
.project
.settings/
